                "text": "\ud83d\udea8I\u2019m still in DC and voting NO on this bill.\n\u274c 800,000 Virginians \u2014 300,000 kids \u2014 could lose food assistance.\n\u274c 323,000 Virginians could lose their health care.\n\u274c Families could see their ACA premiums skyrocket by $1,300.\n\u274c Commuter tolls? Higher.\n\u274c Local flights out of Dulles? More expensive.\n\nIt\u2019s not fiscal responsibility \u2014 it adds 6 trillion to the debt. I\u2019m fighting back to protect Virginia families who deserve better.",
